<title>USA: Progressive Bank sets 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>Progressive Bank sets 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>FISHKILL, N.Y. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Progressive Bank Inc said Wednesday directors declared a three-for-two stock split payable Dec 10 to holders of record Nov 15.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
